{"channelId":"UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","row":["Rehab United",861,"Hey there! We’re Rehab United, proudly recognized as one of San Diego’s top-rated physical therapy clinics. Our mission is simple: to empower you with the knowledge and tools to prevent injuries, manage chronic pain, and master effective rehabilitation exercises.\n\nWhether you're recovering from an injury, rehabbing post-surgery, or aiming to improve your overall mobility, our channel is dedicated to helping you reach your fitness and wellness goals. Our approach combines Applied Functional Science® with a hands-on perspective. \n\nBut what truly drives us? It’s the joy of seeing you get back to doing the things you love, pain-free and stronger than ever. Join us on your journey to better health and movement!","bryan@rehabunited.com; sean@rehabunited.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:38.803Z","channelId":"UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"5f3ba59b7c0df47f88c0966738ba00e2a456b8b4691cc1fa2004fdbbc356995e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"78aabf3def30c9cc8ae9bac3dd04c22251d7ab5b3b87e9c0c0a119102dcb5bd2"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:38.803Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":861,"raw":"861 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvJXEwoUb_sV3FfZh5LgwOQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:38.803Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"bryan@rehabunited.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.rehabunited.com/physical-therapists/bryan-hill"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:aff11dfcd65e0ab5